// Typecheck the TESTS.
//
// tsconfig.json is the BUILD config: `include: ["src"]` with `rootDir: "src"`,
// which is correct for tsup's dts emit and is why it must stay that way. The
// consequence was that `pnpm typecheck` compiled zero test files — vitest
// transpiles without typechecking, so a type error anywhere in __tests__ was
// invisible to every gate in the repo.
//
// Same strictness as src, deliberately. A lower bar for tests would be another
// claim nothing checks: exactOptionalPropertyTypes and noUncheckedIndexedAccess
// are exactly the flags that catch a test asserting on a shape the API does not
// actually produce.
//
// rootDir widens to the repo root because this config emits nothing.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "rootDir": ".",
    "noEmit": true
  },
  "include": ["src", "__tests__", "scripts/__tests__"]
}
